:174:### G18. Reproducibility needs identity and replay definitions, not only fields\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:193:## Completion consequences\\ndocs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:213:## Evidence and limits of this pass\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:7:## Question, baseline and skeptical audit\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:33:## Findings\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:47:### G1. Reconstruction defines the answer more precisely than the algorithm\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:73:### G2. The normative language and IR contracts remain incomplete\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:98:### G3. Ordinary disclosure uncertainty can leave the promised solver fragment\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:124:### G4. The first corporate accounting package is an inventory of duties\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:145:### G5. No complete filing-to-forecast reference case tests the central workflow\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:164:### G6. Forward economic and probability models remain interfaces\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:192:### G7. Standards, banks and insurance are largely deferred requirements\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:218:### G8. Literature breadth exceeds the depth of the follow-up screening\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:246:### G9. Tool selection is a shortlist, without demonstrated adapter contracts\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:265:### G10. Acceptance and completion are not yet determinate\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:289:## Prioritised repair sequence\\ndocs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md:306:## Review evidence and limits\\nglobal-scientific-coding-agent-policy.md\\nhumanizer-ai-writing-patterns.md\\nscholarly-literature-audit-policy.md\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_9