PL_2024.pdf', 'local_path': 'docs/design/cases/apple/annual-2024.pdf', 'sha256': 'ec74758cd767465362c641cf2fd5d8fedd477aed2bf7f62117e67610435dcb88', 'access_date': '2026-10-02', 'availability_precision': 'filing day; exact EDGAR acceptance time not established here'} hash_match True\nsource {'id': 'interim-2025q1.html', 'url': 'https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000008/aapl-20241228.htm', 'local_path': 'docs/design/cases/apple/interim-2025q1.html', 'sha256': '2f7629f0733f75b3155dd52f7ae6a8724468e3cde1a9ce32fbce96d98f1ec27e', 'access_date': '2026-10-02', 'availability_precision': 'filing day; exact EDGAR acceptance time not established here'} hash_match True\nannual notes 13 headings 13 text hash caaf182340d3846ff54cf967a2d3da7dce82505170665943ea7227e6bed8336e\nannual.note.1 Summary of Significant Accounting Policies 160208 162656 'Note 1 – Summary of Significant Accounting Policies\\n\\nBasis of Presentation and Preparation\\nThe conso' Calendar, consolidation and FIFO policy recorded; complete policy-to-rule conversion pending.\nannual.note.2 Revenue 162656 169452 '\\x0cNote 2 – Revenue\\nThe Company recognizes revenue at the amount to which it expects to be entitled wh' Product/service and segment classifications overlap; performance obligations, deferrals, returns and transaction-price models pending.\nannual.note.3 Earnings Per Share 169452 171112 'Note 3 – Earnings Per Share\\nThe following table shows the computation of basic and diluted earnings ' Dated basic/diluted share denominators retained; dilution calculation unsupported in this marginal stress.\nannual.note.4 Financial Instruments 171112 184808 'Note 4 – Financial Instruments\\n\\nCash, Cash Equivalents and Marketable Securities\\nThe following table' Interest-rate notional and hedge link structured; instrument schedules, valuation and OCI recycling remain unresolved.\nannual.note.5 Property, Plant and Equipment 184808 186313 '\\x0cNote 5 – Property, Plant and Equipment\\nThe f